WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.467
Check this out,

00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:11.300
a word analogy!

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.800
Big is to small,

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.267
as tall is to...

00:00:16.267 --> 00:00:16.867
what?

00:00:16.867 --> 00:00:17.500
A.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:18.100
Wide,

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:18.733
B.

00:00:18.733 --> 00:00:19.367
Short,

00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:19.967
C.

00:00:19.967 --> 00:00:20.600
High,

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:21.833
or D.

00:00:21.833 --> 00:00:22.433
Long?

00:00:22.433 --> 00:00:23.667
Five seconds!

00:00:29.467 --> 00:00:30.667
TIME'S UP!

00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:31.867
It's...

00:00:31.867 --> 00:00:32.400
B,

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:32.933
short!

00:00:32.933 --> 00:00:35.567
Big and small are opposites,

00:00:35.567 --> 00:00:39.267
so the opposite of tall is short.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:41.033
Okay,

00:00:41.033 --> 00:00:42.933
a number series!

00:00:42.933 --> 00:00:43.600
Three,

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:44.233
eleven,

00:00:44.233 --> 00:00:44.867
nineteen,

00:00:44.867 --> 00:00:45.500
twenty-seven,

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:46.767
and then...

00:00:46.767 --> 00:00:48.667
what comes next?

00:00:48.667 --> 00:00:49.300
A.

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:49.933
Thirty-eight,

00:00:49.933 --> 00:00:50.600
B.

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:51.233
Thirty-four,

00:00:51.233 --> 00:00:51.867
C.

00:00:51.867 --> 00:00:52.500
Thirty-five,

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:53.767
or D.

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:54.400
Thirty-three?

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:55.667
Five seconds!

00:01:01.467 --> 00:01:02.667
TIME'S UP!

00:01:03.333 --> 00:01:04.833
The answer is...

00:01:04.833 --> 00:01:05.333
C,

00:01:05.333 --> 00:01:05.833
thirty-five!

00:01:05.833 --> 00:01:08.867
Each number goes up by eight,

00:01:08.867 --> 00:01:11.867
so the next one is twenty-seven

00:01:11.867 --> 00:01:13.900
plus eight is thirty-five.

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:16.133
Here's one,

00:01:16.133 --> 00:01:17.800
a picture puzzle!

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:21.100
Where does the dot move next?

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:21.667
A.

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:22.233
Bottom-right,

00:01:22.233 --> 00:01:22.767
B.

00:01:22.767 --> 00:01:23.333
Top-right,

00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:23.867
C.

00:01:23.867 --> 00:01:24.433
Bottom-left,

00:01:24.433 --> 00:01:25.533
or D.

00:01:25.533 --> 00:01:26.100
Center?

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:27.200
Five seconds!

00:01:32.967 --> 00:01:34.167
TIME'S UP!

00:01:34.833 --> 00:01:36.133
The answer is...

00:01:36.133 --> 00:01:36.567
B,

00:01:36.567 --> 00:01:37.000
top-right!

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.200
The dot steps clockwise around

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:40.067
the corners,

00:01:40.067 --> 00:01:42.667
so the next spot is top-right.

00:01:43.833 --> 00:01:44.233
So,

00:01:44.233 --> 00:01:46.267
are you smart or fart?

00:01:46.267 --> 00:01:48.700
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:49.900
find your rank!

00:01:51.067 --> 00:01:51.400
So,

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:52.800
how did you do?

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:54.167
Comment your score below,

00:01:54.167 --> 00:01:55.533
and follow for more!
